  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "BEAST_START",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你在山林间发现一只受伤的灵兽，它通体雪白，额头有一道金色纹路。\n它警惕地看着你，但没有逃跑。",
      "next_node": "BEAST_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "BEAST_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "灵兽的前腿上有一道深深的伤口，血液已经凝固。它的眼神中带着警惕和求助。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "heal",
          "text": "用灵气为它治疗伤口",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "item_cost",
              "target": "spirit_energy",
              "value": 20
            },
            {
              "type": "relationship_change",
              "target": "spirit_beast",
              "value": 30
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "BEAST_HEAL"
        },
        {
          "id": "observe",
          "text": "远远观察，不打扰它",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill_check",
              "target": "beast_knowledge",
              "operator": ">=",
              "value": 10
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "BEAST_OBSERVE_CHECK"
        },
        {
          "id": "capture",
          "text": "用灵气尝试强行捕捉",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "combat_check",
              "target": "capture_beast",
              "operator": ">=",
              "value": 20
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "BEAST_CAPTURE_CHECK"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BEAST_HEAL",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你运转灵气，小心翼翼地为其治疗伤口。\n\n灵兽起初有些抗拒，但感受到你的善意后逐渐放松下来。\n\n伤口愈合后，灵兽用头蹭了蹭你的手，表达了感谢。\n\n[b]消耗：[/b]灵气-20\n[b]获得：[/b]临时伙伴\"雪灵狐\"\n[b]效果：[/b]灵气感知+10%",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "give_exp",
          "value": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "beast_knowledge_snow_fox",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BEAST_OBSERVE_CHECK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你躲在远处，仔细观察这只灵兽的特征。",
      "next_node": "BEAST_OBSERVE_RESULT"
    },
    {
      "id": "BEAST_OBSERVE_RESULT",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "[b]识别成功：[/b]这是一只罕见的\"雪灵狐\"，\n属于冰属性灵兽，极为珍贵。\n\n你获得了关于灵兽的知识，随后它自行离开了。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]灵兽知识（雪灵狐图鉴）",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "beast_knowledge_snow_fox",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BEAST_CAPTURE_CHECK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你汇聚灵气，试图用契约阵法强行捕捉这只灵兽。",
      "next_node": "BEAST_CAPTURE_RESULT"
    },
    {
      "id": "BEAST_CAPTURE_RESULT",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "[b]捕捉成功：[/b]灵兽被阵法束缚，但眼神中充满敌意。\n它需要时间驯服才能成为可靠的伙伴。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]灵兽\"雪灵狐\"（敌对状态，需要驯服）",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "give_exp",
          "value": 15
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
